# Cursor context exclusions for connexto-proxy-cli-llms
# (pnpm workspace: apps/api, apps/host-browser-bridge, packages/*).
# .gitignore and Cursor's default list already skip node_modules, lockfiles,
# and .env*. Patterns below cover this repo's build output and local caches,
# and re-include the env contract the agent should still read.

# Secrets stay out of Agent, Tab, and @ mentions.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dependencies and package-manager caches
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.turbo/

# TypeScript emit and test coverage
**/dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Source maps checked in next to generated scripts
**/*.js.map
**/*.d.ts.map

# Local workflow and tool caches
.connexto/
.serena/cache/
.serena/project.local.yml
.vitest-exit.code

*.log
